nergy that travels between enemy units, dealing damage and reducing their attack and spell damage. Each jump deals less damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "jump_damage_reduction_pct", "damage_reduction", "duration", "radius", "jump_delay", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "rubick_arcane_supremacy", "name_zh": "拉比克·奥术至尊", "name_en": "Arcane Supremacy", "description_zh": "拉比克对奥术的熟稔使他拥有更远的施法距离，和额外技能增强。", "description_en": "Rubick's mastery of the arcane allows him to have a larger cast range and bonus spell amplification.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["cast_range", "spell_amp"]}, {"subject": "rubick_spell_steal", "name_zh": "拉比克·技能窃取", "name_en": "Spell Steal", "description_zh": "拉比克钻研一个敌方英雄的魔法精华之痕，学习这个英雄最后释放的技能的秘密。拉比克将可以使用这个技能，维持几分钟或直到他死亡。", "description_en": "Rubick studies the trace magical essence of one enemy hero, learning the secrets of the last spell the hero cast. Rubick can use this spell as his own for several minutes or until he dies.", "notes_zh": ["无法窃取物品类技能。", "拉比克若拥有阿哈利姆魔晶，则窃取的技能会是魔晶升级版本。", "不会触发法术反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "可窃取的技能提升至2个。提升施法距离，并且窃取的技能会升级成神杖版本。", "en": "Increases the number of spells that can be stolen to 2. Increases cast range, and upgrades stolen spells to their Scepter version."}, "shard": {"zh": "窃取的技能升级为相应的魔晶版本。", "en": "Upgrades stolen spells to their Shard version."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["cast_range_scepter", "projectile_speed", "stolen_mana_reduction", "stolen_spell_cooldown_percent", "spell_amp_percent", "duration", "curiosity_steal_factor", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "rubick_curiosity", "name_zh": "拉比克·奇心", "name_en": "Curiosity", "description_zh": "拉比克现在每级获得%curiosity_per_level%层奇心的叠加效果，每层奇心提供%curiosity_attack_damage%点基础攻击力，%curiosity_modifier_amp%%%增益/减益持续时间，和%curiosity_aoe_bonus%作用范围加成。如果拉比克看到%charge_radius%范围内有敌方英雄施放技能，他就会获得%curiosity_per_spell_cast%层奇心，持续%curiosity_duration%秒。如果当前提供临时奇心的敌人在受到来自拉比克的伤害后%grace_period%秒内阵亡，他就会永久获得%curiosity_per_kill%层奇心。", "description_en": "Rubick gains %curiosity_per_level% stack of Curiosity per level that grants him %curiosity_attack_damage% base damage, %curiosity_modifier_amp%%% Buff/Debuff Duration, and %curiosity_aoe_bonus% AOE Bonus. If Rubick sees an enemy Hero cast an ability within %charge_radius% distance of him, he gains %curiosity_per_spell_cast% Curiosity for %curiosity_duration% seconds.  If an enemy Hero dies while Rubick has Curiosity from them and he damaged them in the last %grace_period% seconds, he gains %curiosity_per_kill% Curiosity permanently.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["curiosity_per_spell_cast", "curiosity_duration", "curiosity_per_level", "curiosity_attack_damage", "curiosity_modifier_amp", "curiosity_aoe_bonus", "curiosity_per_kill", "grace_period", "curiosity_factor", "charge_radius", "curiosity_permanent_gain", "current_debuff_amp", "current_aoe_bonus"]}, {"subject": "disruptor_thunder_strike", "name_zh": "干扰者·风雷之击", "name_en": "Thunder Strike", "description_zh": "用闪电反复打击目标单位。每次打击会伤害附近小范围内的敌方单位，并施加%slow_duration%秒的%slow_amount%%%攻击速度和移动速度降低效果。提供目标的视野。", "description_en": "Repeatedly strikes the targeted unit with lightning.  Each strike damages nearby enemy units in a small radius and slows enemy movement and attack speed by %slow_amount%%% for %slow_duration% seconds.  Provides vision of its target.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "strikes", "strike_interval", "strike_damage", "strike_damage_bonus", "slow_duration", "slow_amount", "shard_ground_delay", "hits_units_inside_kinetic", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "disruptor_glimpse", "name_zh": "干扰者·恶念瞥视", "name_en": "Glimpse", "description_zh": "将目标英雄传送回他%backtrack_time%秒前所在位置。瞬间消灭幻象单位。根据瞥视距离的一定百分比造成伤害，不能超过最大伤害。", "description_en": "Teleports the target hero back to where it was %backtrack_time% seconds ago.  Instantly kills illusions. Deals damage equal to a percentage of the distance glimpsed, that cannot go over a damage maximum.", "notes_zh": ["飞行时间由目标的飞行距离决定。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["backtrack_time", "cast_range", "min_damage", "max_damage", "damage_to_distance_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "disruptor_kinetic_field", "name_zh": "干扰者·动能力场", "name_en": "Kinetic Field", "description_zh": "在短暂的构造时间后，创造一个敌人无法通过的环形动能屏障。", "description_en": "After a short formation time, creates a circular barrier of kinetic energy that enemies can't pass.", "notes_zh": ["力场不能困住减益免疫单位。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "formation_time", "duration", "damage_per_second", "wall_thickness", "tick_rate", "cooldown_share", "strike_on_touch", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "disruptor_kinetic_fence", "name_zh": "干扰者·动能栅栏", "name_en": "Kinetic Fence", "description_zh": "在短暂的构造时间后，创造一面敌人无法通过的动能墙壁。", "description_en": "After a short formation time, creates a wall out of kinetic energy that enemies cannot pass.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["wall_width", "wall_thickness", "radius", "formation_time", "duration", "damage_per_second", "tick_rate", "cooldown_share", "strike_on_touch", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "disruptor_electromagnetic_repulsion", "name_zh": "干扰者·电磁排斥", "name_en": "Electromagnetic Repulsion", "description_zh": "每当干扰者受到%effect_radius%范围内来自任意来源的%damage_threshold%点伤害，附近所有敌人都会受到%damage_per_int%倍干扰者智力值的伤害，并且被推开最多%effect_radius%距离。", "description_en": "Whenever Disruptor takes more than %damage_threshold% damage from any source within %effect_radius% radius, all nearby enemies within take damage equal to %damage_per_int%x of Disruptor's Intelligence, and are pushed back up to a %effect_radius% distance away.", "notes_zh": ["%damage_reset_interval%秒后伤害计数会重置。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["damage_threshold", "effect_radius", "knockback_duration", "damage_reset_interval", "damage_per_int", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "disruptor_static_storm", "name_zh": "干扰者·静态风暴", "name_en": "Static Storm", "description_zh": "创造一场静态风暴，在持续时间内伤害并沉默区域内的所有敌方单位。伤害刚开始时很低，但会在持续时间内逐渐增加。", "description_en": "Creates a damaging static storm that also silences all enemy units in the area for the duration.  The damage starts off weak, but increases in power over the duration.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "锁闭物品。", "en": "Mutes items."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "pulses", "damage_max", "duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_impale", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·穿刺", "name_en": "Impale", "description_zh": "岩石尖刺在地上沿一条直线穿刺而出。敌方单位受到伤害，然后被抛向空中，落地时被眩晕。", "description_en": "Rock spikes burst from the earth along a straight path. Enemy units take damage, then are hurled into the air and stunned.", "notes_zh": ["尖刺的移动速度是每秒%speed%，最远作用距离为%length%。", "穿刺不会被林肯法球格挡。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["width", "duration", "length", "speed", "impale_damage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_jolt", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·神智爆裂", "name_en": "Mind Flare", "description_zh": "造成等同于目标最大魔法值一定百分比的伤害，并燃烧部分魔法。另外还会根据过去%damage_echo_duration%秒内目标受到来自司夜刺客的伤害再造成一定百分比的伤害。施加伤害前会重置累计伤害。", "description_en": "Deals damage equal to a percentage of the target's Max Mana and burns part of it away. Deals additional damage equal to a percentage of the damage the target has taken from Nyx Assassin in the last %damage_echo_duration%s. Resets accumulated damage before applying damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_mana_as_damage_pct", "mana_burn_pct", "aoe", "damage_echo_duration", "damage_echo_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_spiked_carapace", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·尖刺外壳", "name_en": "Spiked Carapace", "description_zh": "激活状态下，尖刺外壳可以反弹并无效化司夜刺客受到的伤害（每个攻击者最多作用一次），同时眩晕攻击者。激活尖刺外壳不会打破复仇的隐身状态。\n\n钻地状态下尖刺外壳施放后将立刻眩晕周围的敌人。", "description_en": "When activated while above ground, Spiked Carapace reflects and negates damage dealt to Nyx Assassin (max once from each source), as well as stunning the source of the damage. Activating Spiked Carapace will not break Vendetta invisibility.\n\nWhile Burrowed, Spiked Carapace instantly stuns nearby enemies when cast.", "notes_zh": ["反弹的伤害与司夜刺客本应受到的实际伤害相同。", "尖刺外壳只有在受到玩家控制来源的伤害后会反弹。", "反弹的伤害与司夜刺客受到的伤害类型相同。", "这个技能造成的伤害被视为反弹伤害。反弹伤害不提供任何吸血，而且无法反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["reflect_duration", "stun_duration", "damage_reflect_pct", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_burrow", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·钻地", "name_en": "Burrow", "description_zh": "司夜刺客经过短时间的掘地后钻入地下。钻地后尖刺外壳一施放就会直接眩晕附近所有敌人，神智爆裂和穿刺的施法距离提升，穿刺的冷却时间减少。钻地后司夜刺客固定在原地，无法攻击，并且是隐身状态。同时司夜刺客受到的所有伤害都会降低。", "description_en": "Nyx Assassin buries himself beneath the battlefield over a short duration. Once burrowed, Spiked Carapace instantly stuns nearby enemies when cast, the range of Mind Flare and Impale is increased, and Impale's cooldown is decreased. While burrowed, Nyx Assassin is stationary, unable to attack, and invisible. Nyx Assassin gains damage reduction from all damage sources.", "notes_zh": ["施放复仇将取消钻地状态。"], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["health_regen_rate", "mana_regen_rate", "damage_reduction", "cast_range", "cooldown_reduction", "carapace_radius", "AbilityCastPoint"]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_neuro_sting", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·法力燃烧", "name_en": "Mana Burn", "description_zh": "司夜刺客对敌人造成伤害还会燃烧造成伤害一定百分比的魔法。", "description_en": "Nyx Assassin's damage on enemies also burns mana as a percentage of the damage dealt.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["mana_burn_pct"]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_vendetta", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·复仇", "name_en": "Vendetta", "description_zh": "司夜刺客进入隐身状态并获得移动速度加成。如果司夜刺客以攻击打破隐身，当次攻击将造成超高额外伤害，并对目标施加破坏效果。司夜刺客当次攻击具有%attack_range_bonus%额外攻击距离，并且攻击动作加快%attack_animation_bonus%%%。", "description_en": "Nyx Assassin becomes invisible and gains a speed bonus. If Nyx Assassin attacks to break the invisibility, massive bonus damage is dealt with the attack that applies a break to the target. Nyx Assassin has %attack_range_bonus% additional attack range and a %attack_animation_bonus%%% faster attack animation for this attack.", "notes_zh": ["如果在隐身期间使用了技能，或者隐身时间结束，额外伤害的效果将会消失。", "会在造成额外伤害前施加破坏效果。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "冷却时间减少%bonus_AbilityCooldown%秒。在复仇的最初%free_pathing_duration%秒内，司夜刺客为极速状态，并且移动无视地形。", "en": "Decreases cooldown by %bonus_AbilityCooldown%s. For the first %free_pathing_duration%s of Vendetta, Nyx is hasted and has unobstructed pathing."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "movement_speed", "bonus_damage", "health_regen_rate_scepter", "mana_regen_rate_scepter", "break_duration", "free_pathing_duration", "free_pathing_movement_speed_bonus", "attack_animation_bonus", "attack_range_bonus", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "naga_siren_mirror_image", "name_zh": "娜迦海妖·镜像", "name_en": "Mirror Image", "description_zh": "制造多个受娜迦海妖控制的镜像。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Creates multiple images of Naga Siren under her control.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["娜迦海妖在施法时有%invuln_duration%秒的无敌时间，可以用来躲避眩晕和伤害。", "施放后，将会移除娜迦海妖身上大部分效果。", "施放时现有的镜像幻象将被摧毁。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["illusion_duration", "outgoing_damage", "outgoing_damage_tooltip", "incoming_damage", "tooltip_incoming_damage_total_pct", "images_count", "invuln_duration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "naga_siren_ensnare", "name_zh": "娜迦海妖·诱捕", "name_en": "Ensnare", "description_zh": "打断目标的动作并将其困在原地，使其无法移动或闪烁。可以对海妖之歌作用下的单位施放。", "description_en": "Interrupts the target and traps them in place, preventing movement or blinking. Can target units affected by Song of the Siren.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升施法距离和弹道速度。诱捕可以对减益免疫单位施放并且生效。诱捕会施加破坏效果。", "en": "Increases cast range and projectile speed.  Allows Ensnare to target and affect Debuff Immune units. Ensnare applies Break."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "net_speed", "fake_ensnare_distance", "can_target_magic_immune", "does_break", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "naga_siren_rip_tide", "name_zh": "娜迦海妖·激流", "name_en": "Rip Tide", "description_zh": "娜迦海妖和她的幻象每经过%hits%次攻击后就会对敌人造成额外伤害，并降低他们的护甲，持续%duration%秒。", "description_en": "Naga Siren and her illusions deal bonus damage to enemies and reduce their armor for %duration% seconds every %hits% attacks.", "notes_zh": ["使用激流不会打断持续施法。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["hits", "armor_reduction", "damage", "radius", "duration"]}, {"subject": "naga_siren_eelskin", "name_zh": "娜迦海妖·鳗鱼皮", "name_en": "Eelskin", "description_zh": "娜迦海妖拥有闪避加成，%radius%内每增加一个娜迦海妖都会提升。", "description_en": "Naga Siren has bonus evasion, increased per every other Naga Siren within %radius% radius.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["evasion_per_naga", "radius"]}, {"subject": "naga_siren_song_of_the_siren", "name_zh": "娜迦海妖·海妖之歌", "name_en": "Song of the Siren", "description_zh": "娜迦海妖周围的所有敌人受到魔法影响陷入停滞状态，既无法行动也不会受到攻击。再次使用海妖之歌可以提前停止效果。", "description_en": "All enemies in range of the Naga Siren are put into a magical stasis where they cannot act or be attacked. Using Song of the Siren again will end the duration early.", "notes_zh": ["海妖之歌作用下的单位处于无敌状态，不会受到任何伤害。", "海妖之歌的作用范围以娜迦海妖为中心，如果她远离了作用单位，他们将会醒来。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "海妖之歌范围内友军每秒会恢复一定百分比的生命和魔法。", "en": "Allies in range of Song of the Siren recover a percentage of their health and mana per second."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "duration", "animation_rate", "heal_pct", "mana_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "keeper_of_the_light_illuminate", "name_zh": "光之守卫·冲击波", "name_en": "Illuminate", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 引导光的能量，持续施法的时间越长，威力越大。释放后，光波沿直线向前发出，造成伤害并获得沿途的视野。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Channels light energy, building power the longer it's channeled.  Once released, a wave is sent forth that deals damage and gives vision in its path.  The longer it is channeled, the more damage is dealt.", "notes_zh": ["在持续施法期间获得的视野不断增大。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["total_damage", "max_channel_time", "radius", "range", "speed", "vision_radius", "vision_duration", "channel_vision_radius", "channel_vision_interval", "channel_vision_duration", "channel_vision_step", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "keeper_of_the_light_blinding_light", "name_zh": "光之守卫·致盲之光", "name_en": "Blinding Light", "description_zh": "一道致盲之光在目标区域闪现，把区域内的单位击退到区域边缘，并造成致盲，使他们的部分攻击不能命中。最短击退距离是在%knockback_duration%秒内击退%knockback_distance%距离。", "description_en": "A blinding light flashes over the targeted area, knocking back units to the edge of the area and blinding them, causing them to miss some attacks. Minimum knockback distance is %knockback_distance% range over %knockback_duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": ["落地后受作用单位将摧毁150范围内的树木。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["miss_rate", "duration", "radius", "knockback_duration", "knockback_distance", "damage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}]
